OL,3,GNEWSANew ferry officially enters
OL,4,Aservice on the River Mersey
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new ferry has officially entered
OL,7,Fservice on the River Mersey for the
OL,8,Ffirst time in more than 60 years.
OL,10,FFollowing a series of sea trials and
OL,11,Fpassenger trips, including one carrying
OL,12,Fthe prime minister, the Royal Daffodil
OL,13,Fwill now operate regular commuter
OL,14,Fcrossings as well as sightseeing and
OL,15,Fevening cruises.
OL,17,FThe #26m vessel arrived on Merseyside
OL,18,Fin September and is the first new
OL,19,Faddition to the iconic Mersey Ferries
OL,20,Ffleet since the 1960s.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
