OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSANew ferry officially enters
OL,4,Aservice on the River Mersey
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiverpool City Region Mayor Steve
OL,7,FRotheram said the new ferry would help
OL,8,Fsafeguard the service for future
OL,9,Fgenerations. He said: "We've got a
OL,10,Fresponsibility to protect these iconic
OL,11,Fferries for future generations, and the
OL,12,FRoyal Daffodil is the next step in
OL,13,Fmaking sure that happens."
